				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p>At Elsy Leonso Insurance, we provide quick service without the hassle of the state agency. Most of our transactions only require 10 minutes or less of your time. Come in, complete your transaction, and get back to your regular schedule without any trouble. We make vehicle registration in Maryland simple.</p><p><strong>Here are the tag and title services we offer in Maryland:</strong></p><div class="symple-column symple-one-half symple-column-first ">• Temporary plates<br>• Duplicate titles<br>• Plate replacement<br>• Bay plates<br>• Agricultural plates<br>• Replacement registrations<br>• Substitute stickers• Farm truck plates<br>• New-to-state registration<br>• Insurance compliance cases<br>• Tag returns</div>								</div>
